      ],
      "image": "assets/images/20120/step_01.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Mix sugar and eggs together in a large bowl until smooth.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/Npt8ZlNs_OeNu5VEP27YL2PM5rI=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/20120-peach-ice-cream-VAT-006-step-02-500333d70fa54ec8befbe5afc32c0c95.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/20120/step_02.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Puree peaches in a blender or food processor; stir 5 cups of puree into egg mixture. Stir in cream, half-and-half, vanilla, and salt until combined.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/AZh4FltdclA1OobrztnHHPDzDOg=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/20120-peach-ice-cream-VAT-007-step-03-9b5e8b7d08ae47588aec58f868c956d1.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/20120/step_03.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Pour mixture into an ice cream maker and freeze according to manufacturer's instructions, about 20 minutes.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/8Mo6xNJySQcz-lcOFgJbmJ08Lgo=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/20120-peach-ice-cream-VAT-008-step-04-106dbeda27444e5b9ba136948a3c9f4e.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/20120/step_04.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Transfer to an airtight container and freeze until firm or desired consistency, about 2 to 4 hours. Enjoy!",
